    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare to unravel the mysteries of Anomaly Company!</strong>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU AND YOUR TEAM FIGURE OUT WHATS OUT OF THE ORDINARY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Anomaly Company you and <strong>co-players</strong> have to <strong>try and escape</strong> by noticing <strong>Anomalies</strong> and making the decision to vote wether an anomaly is active or not. If you have decided correctly you progress to the next level. Otherwise you are reset to the first level. Will you ever escape...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>1-4 player online co-op</strong> <br>Explore a multiplayer experience with up to 4 players. Communicate and help each other through <strong>text chat</strong> or <strong>proximity voice chat</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get to the exit</strong>  <br>Navigating through the levels, some more mysterious than others, you'll encounter anomalies that defy logic and reason. Keep your senses sharp as you search for hidden clues and spot anomalies to get closer towards escaping at Level 10</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1-4 player online co-op</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replayability</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Socialize with friends or strangers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Chat &amp; Voicechat</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immerse yourself in  atmospheric environments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Get frightened, jumpscares</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Finding anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to unravel the mysteries of Anomaly Company. Can you escape, or will you become lost forever? It's up to you, but remember, not everything is as it seems...   </p>",
